  "html": "<section class=\"py-12 md:py-20\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\">\n<div class=\"relative max-w-sm mx-auto\">\n\n                                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 mb-10 -mt-14 -mx-14 bg-slate-100 -z-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n                                        <div class=\"testimonial-carousel swiper-container max-w-sm mx-auto sm:max-w-none\">\n                                            <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n\n                                                \n                                                <div class=\"swiper-slide flex flex-col h-auto shadow-2xl text-left\">\n                                                    <div class=\"relative after:absolute after:inset-0 after:bg-linear-to-t after:from-slate-700\">\n                                                        <img src=\"/api/tenant/template-assets/fintech-html/images/testimonial-01.jpg\" class=\"md:max-w-none\" width=\"384\" height=\"180\" alt=\"Testiomonial 01\" data-ve-img=\"1\" />\n                                                    </div>\n                                                    <div class=\"grow flex flex-col relative bg-linear-to-t from-slate-800 to-slate-700 p-6 pt-14\">\n                                                        <img class=\"absolute bottom-full translate-y-1/2\" src=\"/api/tenant/template-assets/fintech-html/images/testimonial-sign-01.svg\" width=\"150\" height=\"71\" alt=\"Testiomonial sign 01\" data-ve-img=\"1\" />\n                                                        <p class=\"grow font-medium text-slate-200 mb-4\" data-ve-text=\"1\">“ This card is awesome. The app lets me link foreign cards with a new one which makes everything 100 times easier. Like Apple Pay, online shopping without useless phone confirmation. I wish I knew this earlier. ”</p>\n            